# vhs tape — re-record with: vhs docs/assets/simulate-drop.tape
Output docs/assets/simulate-drop.gif

Set FontSize 13
Set Width 1150
Set Height 620
Set Padding 12
Set TypingSpeed 25ms
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"

Type "npm run cli -- simulate-drop -e https://api.mainnet-beta.solana.com,https://api.devnet.solana.com -d https://api.mainnet-beta.solana.com --after 2 --duration 4 -n 12 -i 500"
Enter
Sleep 19s
